Package: statnextr
Title: R Backend for the StatNext Desktop Statistics App
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Mahesh", "Divakaran", email = "itsmdivakaran@users.noreply.github.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: JSON-RPC server, analysis module registry, code generation runner,
    data import and result formatting used by the StatNext desktop application.
    Every analysis is generated as plain R code, evaluated, and returned with that
    code so results are fully reproducible outside the app.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.4.0)
Imports:
    jsonlite,
    glue,
    utils,
    stats
Suggests:
    effectsize,
    car,
    ggnext,
    ggplot2,
    rsvg,
    readxl,
    haven,
    arrow,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
